        "jcr:created": "Mon Jun 24 2024 20:41:13 GMT+0000",
        "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
        "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">We understand that streamlined access to the treatment site could allow you to treat your patient faster and potentially prevent complications.<sup>1&nbsp;</sup>AXS Lift is the first of its kind intracranial base catheter designed to give you the simplicity of a biaxial setup with the support of a triaxial system.</span></p>\n",
